      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIFTY THREE STARS (2) has been racing well since recording back-to-back wins here in August. Came from a much wider barrier and finished fifth at his latest appearance. Strikes at 50 per cent at this venue and has the benefit of a good draw so may prove tough to beat. STARZZZ DESTINY (4) produced a good effort when he worked to the front and stuck on for third here last week, beaten 3 metres. Can be on the pace again from this draw. Big chance. SPUNKYS GOTSECRETS (7) draws wide but looks close to a win and is right in contention after back-to-back seconds. QUIK CHANGE (1) had a tough barrier last start but the prior form was sound and he is better served by the ace draw. FRANCS FOR COMING (9) deserves respect after winning three of his last four outings, one of them from this row.",
